<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPAIN 4 SLOVAKIA 1 RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPAIN 4 SLOVAKIA 1 RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>TENERIFE, Spain 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the World Cup European group six qualifying match on Wednesday. Spain 4 Slovakia 1 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Spain - Juan Pizzi 32, Guillermo Amor 46, Luis Enrique Martinez 56, Fernando Hierro 61</p>
<p>Slovakia - Dusan Tittel 39  </p>
<p>Group six standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Yugoslavia	   4   4   0   0  18   2  12</p>
<p> Slovakia	     4   3   0   1  12   5   9</p>
<p> Spain		  3   2   1   0  10   3   7</p>
<p> Czech Republic     3   1   1   1   6   1   4</p>
<p> Faroe Islands	5   0   0   5   5  22   0</p>
<p> Malta		  3   0   0   3   0  18   0</p>
<p>Next matches: Dec  14 - Spain v Yugoslavia, Dec 18 - Malta v</p>
<p>v Spain</p>
